--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
dropped the body
--
A requires-expression whose parameter pack is expanded in a new-initializer
(`::new(loc) T(forward<Types>(_Args)...)', as in the MSVC STL's
std::construct_at) left the pack unexpanded: "symbol '_Args' is unknown",
and the caller lost its body (_Construct_in_place, 9 cbmc-cpp tests on
VS 2022).
